.TH QUIPU-DATABOOK-IMPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-databook\-import \- Load a DataBook\*(Aqs graph blocks in one write; never runs its queries
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu databook import\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-shapes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIfile.databook.md\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load a DataBook\*(Aqs graph blocks in one write; never runs its queries
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-with\-shapes\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIfile.databook.md\fR>

